        "TileImage": "$($repository 486c204d-773b-4103-b4f4-829a3d944161).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47. Good morning 47. I dont know how, but do you remember this old ICA agent named Sebastian Sato? Well, he&apos;s not dead, he just texted me that he wants to meet me at the Dartmoor manor summer party. The plan goes like this. I&apos;m not going to go myself, but I&apos;m saying it&apos;ll take me a while to get there. In the meantime, you go and eliminate Sebastian. I&apos;ve been scanning the area with a drone, and I noticed a sniper rifle in a guard booth. Maybe you could have a use for that. Good luck",
